# Binaries
/bin/
/keeperd
/keeper
/keeper-mcp

# Frontend build and dependencies
web/node_modules/
web/dist/

# The embedded UI is build output. internal/api/dist/index.html is committed as a
# placeholder so //go:embed has something to find and `go build ./...` works on a
# fresh clone; `make ui` replaces it with the real bundle.
internal/api/dist/*
!internal/api/dist/index.html

# Local state
.keeper/catalog.local.yaml
*.age

# Local harness configuration. Nothing that configures an agent belongs in a
# repository whose whole subject is what an agent is allowed to see.
/.claude/
CLAUDE.md
AGENTS.md

# Design documents. They are the working record — the specification, the decision
# log, the review triage, the interface spec and the build contract — and they
# stay local. The code's comments cite them by section; the reasoning a comment
# needs is in the comment.
/SPEC.md
/DECISIONS.md
/REVIEW.md
/UI.md
/CONTRACT.md
